1
00:00:02,397 --> 00:00:03,997
(Sheldon:)Would you pass
the mustard?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,100
(Leonard:)Sure.

3
00:00:05,101 --> 00:00:06,931
(Leonard:)Hey, want to hear
a fun fact about mustard?

4
00:00:06,936 --> 00:00:09,836
(Sheldon:)Is it that the glucosinolates
which give mustard its flavor

5
00:00:09,839 --> 00:00:11,209
(Sheldon:)were evolved
by the cabbage family

6
00:00:11,207 --> 00:00:13,837
as a chemical defense
against caterpillars?

7
00:00:13,843 --> 00:00:15,473
(Leonard:)Yeah.

8
00:00:16,845 --> 00:00:18,645
(Sheldon:)Well, that was fun.

9
00:00:18,648 --> 00:00:20,778
(Sheldon:)Good for you, Leonard.

10
00:00:20,783 --> 00:00:22,313
(Raj(entering with Howard):)Hey, there.

11
00:00:22,318 --> 00:00:23,318
(Leonard:)Hey, you're early.

12
00:00:23,319 --> 00:00:25,049
(Leonard:)The movie doesn't start
for an hour.

13
00:00:25,054 --> 00:00:26,684
(Howard:)Actually, we're not
going to the movies.

14
00:00:26,689 --> 00:00:29,359
(Howard:)We are here to kidnap you.

15
00:00:29,358 --> 00:00:30,688
(Leonard:)What are you talking about?

16
00:00:30,693 --> 00:00:32,493
(Raj:)Well, you eloped and
we didn't get a chance

17
00:00:32,495 --> 00:00:33,925
(Raj:)to throw you
a bachelor party,

18
00:00:33,929 --> 00:00:35,459
(Raj:)so there's
a van downstairs

19
00:00:35,464 --> 00:00:37,094
(Raj:)and we're here
to take you

20
00:00:37,099 --> 00:00:39,099
(Raj:)to a surprise location
for the weekend.

21
00:00:39,101 --> 00:00:41,271
(Sheldon:)Well, I'd hardly
call this kidnapping.

22
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:42,440
(Sheldon:)Where's the blindfold?

23
00:00:42,438 --> 00:00:43,668
(Sheldon:)Where's the duct tape?

24
00:00:43,673 --> 00:00:45,243
(Sheldon:)Where's the part

25
00:00:45,241 --> 00:00:46,971
(Sheldon:)where you call me
and demand ransom

26
00:00:46,976 --> 00:00:48,476
(Sheldon:)and I try to keep you
on the phone,

27
00:00:48,477 --> 00:00:50,747
(Sheldon:)but you hang up
seconds before I can trace it

28
00:00:50,746 --> 00:00:54,116
and then I say, "I'm getting
too old for this crud"?

29
00:00:56,284 --> 00:00:58,354
(Leonard:)When do we leave?

30
00:00:58,354 --> 00:00:59,284
(Howard:)Right now.

31
00:00:59,288 --> 00:01:00,658
(Raj:)Yeah, Penny packed
you a bag.

32
00:01:00,656 --> 00:01:02,226
(Howard:)Wow, okay.

33
00:01:02,224 --> 00:01:04,124
(Sheldon:)You're seriously going to get
in a van and let these two

34
00:01:04,126 --> 00:01:05,396
(Raj:)take you
to an unknown destination

35
00:01:05,394 --> 00:01:06,864
(Sheldon:)for an entire weekend?

36
00:01:06,862 --> 00:01:08,762
Oh, not just him;
you're coming, too.

37
00:01:08,764 --> 00:01:11,394
(Sheldon:)Oh, and how do you think you're
going to get me to do that?

38
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,430
Unhand me!

39
00:01:12,435 --> 00:01:13,465
This is ridiculous!

40
00:01:13,469 --> 00:01:14,999
(Howard:)I told you to put tape
on his mouth!

41
00:01:15,004 --> 00:01:17,204
And I told you he bit me!

42
00:01:18,340 --> 00:01:21,980
♪Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

